<Comment>
<![CDATA[145 JOG release. Gated by Mode_Manual: without it this rung sees the AUTO sequencer's MAJ in process with no manual jog button pressed, and stops it one scan after AutoSeq_V5 starts it - every step, every axis. The jog start rung was already gated; this is the matching undo.]]>
