<Rung Number="52" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[MAG engage. Master 141, ratio Gear_Ratio_SP, RatioFormat Real, MasterRef Command, Dir Same. All five must be enabled. F1 MAG after import.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Mode_Manual)XIC(Enable_141)XIC(Enable_142)XIC(Enable_143)XIC(Enable_144)XIC(Enable_145)XIC(Gear_Engage_PB)ONS(Gear_ONS)MAG(Zippy_Axis_142,Zippy_Axis_141,MAG_142,0,Gear_Ratio_SP,1,1,1,1,1,100.0,1)MAG(Zippy_Axis_143,Zippy_Axis_141,MAG_143,0,Gear_Ratio_SP,1,1,1,1,1,100.0,1)MAG(Zippy_Axis_144,Zippy_Axis_141,MAG_144,0,Gear_Ratio_SP,1,1,1,1,1,100.0,1)MAG(Zippy_Axis_145,Zippy_Axis_141,MAG_144,0,Gear_Ratio_SP,1,1,1,1,1,100.0,1)OTL(Gear_Active)MOVE(Gear_Ratio_SP,Gear_Ratio_Act);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="53" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[MAG release. MAS StopType Gear (3). Does not MSF.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Gear_Release_PB)ONS(GearRel_ONS)MAS(Zippy_Axis_142,MASG_142,3,1,Jog_Decel,0,0,100.0,2)MAS(Zippy_Axis_143,MASG_143,3,1,Jog_Decel,0,0,100.0,2)MAS(Zippy_Axis_144,MASG_144,3,1,Jog_Decel,0,0,100.0,2)MAS(Zippy_Axis_145,MASG_145,3,1,Jog_Decel,0,0,100.0,2)OTU(Gear_Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="54" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[All_Geared lamp — only true when all four followers report GearingStatus.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Zippy_Axis_142.GearingStatus)XIC(Zippy_Axis_143.GearingStatus)XIC(Zippy_Axis_144.GearingStatus)XIC(Zippy_Axis_145.GearingStatus)OTE(All_Geared);]]>
